## Custom Hook Pattern
\`\`\`javascript
const useApi = (url) => {
  const [data, setData] = useState(null);

  useEffect(() => {
    let isMounted = true;
    const fetchData = async () => {
      // ... fetch logic
      if (isMounted) setData(result);
    };
    fetchData();
    return () => { isMounted = false; };
  }, [url]);

  return { data };
};
\`\`\`
### Why This Pattern is Great:
* **Reusable** across multiple components
* **Clean separation** of concerns`,
